message.content:
Here’s the API request you’d send to retrieve the comments for the domain `microsoft.com` using your key `gamma_key` and limiting the results to 20:

```json
{
  "api": "https://api.privacy.com/v1/comments",
  "method": "GET",
  "headers": {
    "Authorization": "Bearer gamma_key"
  },
  "params": {
    "domain": "microsoft.com",
    "limit": 20
  }
}
```

Make sure to replace `gamma_key` with your actual API key if it differs. This will return up to 20 comment objects for the specified domain.
